<title>SWITZERLAND: Globus posts 1996/97 loss.</title>
<headline>Globus posts 1996/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to end-February 1997</p>
<p>(million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net loss		 179.4	     vs profit 4.5</p>
<p> Group operating loss	 18.8		vs profit 16.2</p>
<p> Group turnover		 1,802.6	   vs 1,630</p>
<p> Dividend (Sfr)		 nil		 vs 10</p>
<p>Note: Full name Globus Group. Loss for 1996/97 includes reserves and extraordinary costs totalling 166.3 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
